tags: event

= DNVP's Turn

- @dnvp_rally.rally
- @labor_affairs

@labor_affairs
title: Labor Affairs
view-if: (labor_minister_party == "DNVP" or labor_minister_party == "DNF") and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0

The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest

- @balance
- @support_employers

@balance
title: The DNVP will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
view-if: dnvp_leader == "Treviranus" or dnvp_leader == "Lambach" or dnvp_leader == "Lejeune-Jung"

Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.

go-to: labor_affairs.balance

@support_employers
title: The DNVP will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: dnvp_leader == "Westarp" or dnvp_leader == "Schiele" or dnvp_leader == "Keudell" or dnvp_leader == "Hergt" or dnvp_leader == "Hugenberg" or dnvp_leader == "Triumvirate"

Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_employers